 and needs only one surviving"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"boundary to place it. value\/attributes are a deep copy so a GC-purged node","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be recreated.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/yorkie_v1_treerestorespan","title":"Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan"}}}